# Trained model output (synced via Google Drive, not Git).
# `model/*` (contents, not the dir) so a repo-tracked exception can
# re-include a file: the sweep's vocabulary artifact is repo-tracked
# precisely because model/ is a GDrive-mirror target whose sync can erase
# local-extra files (WI-103 durability).
model/*
!model/label_centroids.json

